  data: {
    LLM: "Use the Manni exchange wisely - discard weak cards and hope to draw trumps or high cards. In Nullo, get rid of high cards early by playing them when you can't win the trick.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track which high cards have been played, especially in Nullo where you want to avoid taking tricks. In Grand and suit contracts, estimate how many tricks you can realistically win.\n\nContract selection strategy: Choose Grand when you have balanced high cards across suits. Choose a suit contract when you have length and strength in that suit. Choose Nullo when you have low cards and short suits. The exchange decision: Sometimes keeping a moderately strong hand is better than risking the Manni.",
    Player: "Use the Manni exchange wisely - discard weak cards and hope to draw trumps or high cards. In Nullo, get rid of high cards early by playing them when you can't win the trick.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track which high cards have been played, especially in Nullo where you want to avoid taking tricks. In Grand and suit contracts, estimate how many tricks you can realistically win.\n\nContract selection strategy: Choose Grand when you have balanced high cards across suits. Choose a suit contract when you have length and strength in that suit. Choose Nullo when you have low cards and short suits. The exchange decision: Sometimes keeping a moderately strong hand is better than risking the Manni.",
